[P_04_GCS_Objectives]
Objective_0001=Figure out what Colonel Kims real agenda is.
Objective_0008=Colonel Kim and his men have taken over Train Station, but have not yet issued any demands. Discover what their plans are and stop them.
POPUPMESSAGE_0030=Figure out what Colonel Kims real agenda is.
Objective_0002=Deactivate the bombs under Train Station.
Objective_0009=Kims men have planted three bombs in the subway tunnels. The bombs are extremely powerful and could collapse several city blocks. The bombs must be disarmed.
Objective_0003=Bug the telephone in Train Station Hall before Chu reaches it.
Objective_0010=Chu, and agent of Kims, will be receiving a telephone call on a payphone in the main hall. Bug the telephone before the call comes in order to overhear the conversation.
POPUPMESSAGE_0031=Deactivate the bombs under Train Station.
Objective_0014=Get the antidote from the locker.
Objective_0015=Chu is going to recover a sample of the antidote from a locker. Discover which locker and neutralize Chu before he uses the antidote himself.
Objective_0042=Eliminate the contaminated soldier in the bathroom.
Objective_0043=Use the antidote to enter the washroom without becoming infected, then eliminate the infected soldier.
Objective_0044=Follow Chu to the locker.
Objective_0045=Follow Chu to the locker.
POPUPMESSAGE_0032=Get the antidote from the locker.
Objective_0046=Secure the chemical toxin in possession of the infected soldier.
Objective_0047=Secure the chemical toxin in possession of the infected soldier.
POPUPMESSAGE_0048=Eliminate the contaminated soldier in the bathroom.
Objective_0018=Stop Kims men from leaving with the rest of the toxin.
Objective_0019=Get to the subway platform and stop the rest of Kims men from escaping before its too late.
Objective_0006=Jump on the subway car to follow it to its destination.
Objective_0013=It is too late to stop Kims men from escaping. Jump down onto the roof of the passing subway car and follow them to their next destination.
POPUPMESSAGE_0034=Jump on the subway car to follow it to its destination.
Objective_0022=Recover schematics for the bombs.
Objective_0023=Recover schematics for the bombs.
POPUPMESSAGE_0035=Deactivate the bombs under Train Station.
POPUPMESSAGE_0036=Get the antidote and toxin from the locker.
